Title: The Parking Ticket
Author: Studio KILSAT
Draft: 2

FADE IN:

INT. KITCHEN - MORNING

Wide shot. MIRA stands by the window with her phone.

MIRA
(quietly)
Did you move the car last night?

NIKO (O.S.)
Define "move".

Niko walks in from the left, two seconds.
He stops and looks at Mira.

MIRA
You parked it on the sidewalk.

Beat.

NIKO
It was a very wide sidewalk.

CLOSE-UP on Mira. She raises an eyebrow.
Mira shows Niko the phone.
Niko glances at the phone, then sits down.

MIRA (CONT'D)
Eighty euros.

Niko nods slowly and waves.
A long pause.
Meanwhile Mira crouches and points at the window.
They both jump.
Niko runs to the right 1.5 seconds.

Mira smiles.

CUT TO:

EXT. STREET - NIGHT

Tracking shot: Niko walks forward.
Do not move the camera.

FADE OUT.
